{"3411360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Train Jumble", "steam_appid": 3411360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/34863aff1b0ec9bcd58c5294fb2d721c.avif?t=1786110929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras_big/34863aff1b0ec9bcd58c5294fb2d721c.webp?t=1786110929 width=1560 height=601 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/9cf23e7676a8beb2f4fd22a23026ce38.avif?t=1786110929\" width=478 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip for you to buy new modules for your train while unhappy passengers will eventually leave out of frustration. Once three passengers left, it’s game over; so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/434c1d7ea9e6946ba12c122932147181.avif?t=1786110929\" width=430 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don’t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/23dff4a73d2fc807f257f2eca7f3669d.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/23dff4a73d2fc807f257f2eca7f3669d.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/23dff4a73d2fc807f257f2eca7f3669d.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/33414a0572fcb44f74ee2a09441f17cf.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/33414a0572fcb44f74ee2a09441f17cf.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/33414a0572fcb44f74ee2a09441f17cf.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/06713235fa3fa519c6a9a305e48e2b82.avif?t=1786110929\" width=566 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/7fc68d5c5115579cede6e1e893f31583.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/f6c10d00d400bd86f95293db81779efb.avif?t=1786110929\" width=335 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the playtest, you’ll be travelling our home region of Bavaria. However, the final game will include much of Europe. Maybe you’ll even find a cool town for your next holiday!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/1c80787e14a44c77c154b9cf89f1b287.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Jumble is still in active development! So we're always looking for feedback &amp; ideas! Join our Discord server to discuss the game and hang out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/34863aff1b0ec9bcd58c5294fb2d721c.avif?t=1786110929\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras_big/34863aff1b0ec9bcd58c5294fb2d721c.webp?t=1786110929 width=1560 height=601 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/9cf23e7676a8beb2f4fd22a23026ce38.avif?t=1786110929\" width=478 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your passengers so everyone is happy. Happy passengers will give a gracious tip for you to buy new modules for your train while unhappy passengers will eventually leave out of frustration. Once three passengers left, it’s game over; so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/99c16943028b4016991758cc8262a870.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/434c1d7ea9e6946ba12c122932147181.avif?t=1786110929\" width=430 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your train car with seats, a snack machine, a bar or even a music corner! Trains don’t have to be boring and your passengers will demand the most fun ride they can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/23dff4a73d2fc807f257f2eca7f3669d.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/23dff4a73d2fc807f257f2eca7f3669d.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/23dff4a73d2fc807f257f2eca7f3669d.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/33414a0572fcb44f74ee2a09441f17cf.poster.avif?t=1786110929\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/33414a0572fcb44f74ee2a09441f17cf.webm?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/33414a0572fcb44f74ee2a09441f17cf.mp4?t=1786110929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411360/extras/06713235fa3fa519c6a9a305e48e2b82.avif?t=1786110929\" width=566 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your train at each stop making it more accommodating for passengers. The shop lets you purchase new modules from the money you received. Finishing a run will unlock new modules you can use to complete harder routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline